Package: cleanresults
Title: Publication-Ready Regression Tables, Text, and Figures
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Shaye", "Hopkins", email = "shaye.mcd@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3560-7393"))
Description: Fits linear, logistic, count, ordinal, mixed-effects, and
    Bayesian regressions for one or more outcomes and renders a single
    publication-ready table with robust standard errors, explicit reference
    categories, pairwise contrasts, and multiple-comparison corrections within
    factors and across outcomes. Builds results text, hypothesis summaries, and
    figures from the same fitted objects, and checks numbers typed in a
    manuscript against them. Tables render natively in Quarto (HTML, Word,
    PDF) and export to Word, LaTeX (Overleaf), and HTML that pastes cleanly
    into Google Docs.
